  "translation": "Gomme bjale, Yahwe Elohim, tloga o ye kgorong ya go phomola ya gago, wena le ⟨את⟩ araka ya matla a gago; baperisita ba gago, Yahwe Elohim, ba apere phenyo, gomme bao ba hlweretšego go wena ba thabe ka bobotle.",
